Keep a shared source as empty text.
Keep a shared rendered as empty text.
Keep a shared closer as 0.
Keep a shared capacity as 0.
Keep a shared level as 0.
Keep a shared used as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared collection as an empty list of text.
Place "11011000" into source.
Set capacity to 32.
For every slot from 0 to 31, Place 0 into used.
For every slot from 0 to 511.
Place "" into collection.

To locate from start (a whole number) with finish (a whole number).
The depth is 0.
The probe is start.
Set closer to finish.
Repeat while probe is at most finish.
The symbol is the slice of source from probe to probe plus 1.
If symbol matches "1", add 1 to depth.
If symbol matches "0", set depth to depth minus 1.
If depth is 0, set closer to probe, return.
Add 1 to probe.

To arrange with base (a whole number) with count (a whole number).
The lastindex is base plus count minus 1.
For every left from base to lastindex.
For every right from left plus 1 to lastindex, if item left of collection comes before item right of collection, swap item left of collection and item right of collection.

To finishframe.
The base is level times capacity.
The spot is level.
The count is item spot of used.
Arrange with base with count.
The built is empty text.
Place "1" into built.
For every slot from base to base plus count minus 1, Place item slot of collection into built.
Place "0" into built.
Set rendered to built.

To shape from cursor (a whole number) with limit (a whole number).
If cursor is more than limit, finishframe, return.
Locate from cursor with limit.
The childend is closer.
Set item (level plus 1) of used to 0.
Set level to level plus 1.
Shape from cursor plus 1 with childend minus 1.
Set level to level minus 1.
The child is a copy of rendered.
The base is level times capacity.
The spot is level.
The slot is base plus item spot of used.
Set item slot of collection to child.
Set item spot of used to item spot of used plus 1.
Shape from childend plus 1 with limit.

The end is the last position of source.
Set item 0 of used to 0.
Shape from 1 with end minus 1.
Show rendered.
